    "title": "Stickmen Exile Fighter",
    "description": "The eternal battle between Stickmen Exile Fighter and massive ferocious enemies.\r\nStickmen Exile Fighter is a physics game that simulates a thrilling battle between good and evil.\r\n\r\nPlay the role of stickmen hero and use the powerful spear to kill all the dark forces.\r\nThey are coming, fast and dangerous, be careful and prepare for each battle!\r\nFierce blows to suffocation, combat experience has never been so real!\r\nFinish crafting the mighty spear by overcoming tough challenges!\r\n\r\nGame features:\r\n- Many types of cool weapons with different functions\r\n- Upgrade level, equip weapons to create high damage\r\n- Many challenges and obstacles in each level\r\n- Complete missions to receive valuable rewards\r\n- Beautiful, sophisticated graphics\r\n- Diverse battle maps\r\n- Smooth game movement, fierce hits, high damage\r\n- Realistic, lively music like being on the battlefield\r\n- Exchange diamonds for coins\r\n- Daily reward",
    "descriptionHTML": "The eternal battle between Stickmen Exile Fighter and massive ferocious enemies.<br>Stickmen Exile Fighter is a physics game that simulates a thrilling battle between good and evil.<br><br>Play the role of stickmen hero and use the powerful spear to kill all the dark forces.<br>They are coming, fast and dangerous, be careful and prepare for each battle!<br>Fierce blows to suffocation, combat experience has never been so real!<br>Finish crafting the mighty spear by overcoming tough challenges!<br><br>Game features:<br>- Many types of cool weapons with different functions<br>- Upgrade level, equip weapons to create high damage<br>- Many challenges and obstacles in each level<br>- Complete missions to receive valuable rewards<br>- Beautiful, sophisticated graphics<br>- Diverse battle maps<br>- Smooth game movement, fierce hits, high damage<br>- Realistic, lively music like being on the battlefield<br>- Exchange diamonds for coins<br>- Daily reward",
